{
  "_comment": "Broadcast rights by region. ESPN's API is US-only and ignores a region parameter (verified 2026-08-09) — it returns US regional feeds, so a Toronto home game comes back as NESN. For region 'us' the proxy uses ESPN's per-game geoBroadcasts; every other region resolves here. Adding a region is a pure data change: no code, no firmware. See docs/PLAN.md §3.",

